WEBVTT

00:00:27.517 --> 00:00:32.257
Njia pekee wanayotoa ni kinga ya uzazi
kwa jamii yote ya binadamu.

00:00:32.257 --> 00:00:35.477
Je ubiinadamu utakubali kuingia kwenye
biolojia isiyojulikana,

00:00:35.477 --> 00:00:38.327
au wang'ang'anie asili yao na wapotee?

00:00:38.327 --> 00:00:41.317
Maswali kama haya yamejaa kwenye
"Dawn" ya Olivia Butler,

00:00:41.317 --> 00:00:44.217
ya kwanza kwenye simulizi yake ya utatu
ya "Lilith's Brood".

00:00:44.217 --> 00:00:47.237
Msimuliaji anayeona mbali aliyebadilisha
bunilizi ya kisayansi,

00:00:47.237 --> 00:00:50.097
Butler amejenga dunia za kustaajabisha
katika kazi yake --

00:00:50.097 --> 00:00:53.187
na kufumbua mafumbo
yanayotuweka macho usiku.

00:00:53.187 --> 00:00:54.996
Alizaliwa mwaka 1947,

00:00:54.996 --> 00:00:59.046
Butler alikua na aibu na mpole akiishi
Pasadena, California.

00:00:59.046 --> 00:01:01.386
Aliota hadithi akiwa na umri mdogo,